{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122621","id":4318773703,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAWtBxw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122621","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122621.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122621.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122621","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122621/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122621/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122621/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/59aad6eb6cf08e8236dc7f9f745ad1b2b21829e5","number":122621,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add in support for completion tooltip for enum item declarations","user":{"login":"matorin57","id":5014337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5014337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57","html_url":"https://github.com/matorin57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nMissing tool tip for enum declarations and missing doc strings on enum tool tips.\r\n\r\n- Closes #122584 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThe tool tip for anonymous enum item declarations was just a missing call to `make_completion_context`.\r\nFor named enum item declarations, a new completion type was added since to find the correct declaration you need to go inside the named enum. The new completion type was only added to the show tool tip logic and not the auto complete logic.\r\n\r\nI also discovered that doc strings weren't appearing correctly for named enum items. This was because the class for the named enum item passed through to `EditorHelpBit::_get_constant_help_data` was a full path to the named enum like \"\\\"test.gd\\\".AnEnum\". Since this isn't a class no doc was generated for that name. The least intrusive change I could find to fix this was to update `GDScriptDocGen::_generate_docs` so that at the end after adding the main class doc, it will add a copy of the doc under the names of all named enums inside the class. There may be a better way to do this, if so let me know.\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2790